 R←Test_StormGuard_001(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;counts;signatures;html;i
⍝ The crash storm guard is on by default: the INI file does not mention `StormGuard`.
⍝ The same error five times: only the 1st, 2nd and 4th occurrence get the full treatment.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆StormGuardParms'Test_StormGuard_001'⍬
 →T.PassesIf 1≡parms.stormGuard

 counts←signatures←html←⍬
 :For i :In ⍳5
     html,←parms ∆ProvokeCrash 501
     counts,←parms.stormCount
     signatures,←⊂parms.stormSignature
 :EndFor

 →T.PassesIf counts≡1 2 3 4 5
 →T.PassesIf html≡1 2 2 3 3
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢∪signatures
 →T.PassesIf ⎕NEXISTS parms.errorFolder,'/StormGuard.txt'

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
